Subject: [PATCH 01/11] soc: nexell: share S5P6818 drivers across architectures

Signed-off-by: liy <liygfg@gmail.com>
---
 arch/arm/mach-nexell/Kconfig                | 18 +---------------
 drivers/clk/nexell/Kconfig                  |  4 ++--
 drivers/clocksource/Kconfig                 |  2 +-
 drivers/mmc/host/Kconfig                    |  2 +-
 drivers/net/ethernet/stmicro/stmmac/Kconfig |  4 ++--
 drivers/phy/nexell/Kconfig                  |  2 +-
 drivers/pinctrl/nexell/Kconfig              |  2 +-
 drivers/reset/Kconfig                       |  4 ++--
 drivers/soc/Kconfig                         |  1 +
 drivers/soc/nexell/Kconfig                  | 24 +++++++++++++++++++++
 drivers/tty/serial/Kconfig                  |  4 ++--
 drivers/tty/serial/samsung_tty.c            |  2 +-
 drivers/usb/host/Kconfig                    |  4 ++--
